#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/writing-data/en.mdx:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Writing data — for example, by posting to a Bluesky feed — works similarly to [reading data](/guides/reading-data), but with different methods.\n"
msgstr "Blueskyフィードに投稿するなどのデータ書き込みは、[読み取り](/guides/reading-data)に似ていますが、少しやり方が変わります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/writing-data/en.mdx:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<TabGroup defaultValue=\"ts\">\n"
"  <TabList>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"ts\">TypeScript</Tab>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"go\">Go</Tab>\n"
"  </TabList>\n"
"  <TabPanels>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"ts\">\n"
"To create a new record, call `client.create()` with an imported Lexicon, along with any required fields:\n"
msgstr ""
"<TabGroup defaultValue=\"ts\">\n"
"  <TabList>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"ts\">TypeScript</Tab>\n"
"    <Tab value=\"go\">Go</Tab>\n"
"  </TabList>\n"
"  <TabPanels>\n"
"    <TabPanel value=\"ts\">\n"
"新しいレコードの作成には、Lexiconをインポートした`client.create()`に必要なフィールドを添えて呼び出します。\n"

